DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270203
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia Flevariotissa
LOCATION:Flevariotissa monastery\, Astypalaia\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The winter panigiri of Astypalaia\, at the monastery of Flevariotissa in the island's interior on 1-2 February: after vespers the courtyard fills with food cooked by the islanders\, violins and dancing through the night. Only for those who are on the island in winter\, which is exactly its charm.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/astypalaia/#flevariotissa-monastery-panigiri-of-panagia-flevariotissa
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/astypalaia/#flevariotissa-monastery-panigiri-of-panagia-flevariotissa
END:VEVENT
