UID:astypalaia-chora-feast-of-osios-anthimos-chora-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270902
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270904
SUMMARY:Feast of Osios Anthimos\, Chora
LOCATION:Chora\, Astypalaia\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The island's patron\, the monk Anthimos who brought the Portaitissa icon\, is honoured on 3 September with a liturgy and procession through Chora. A quiet\, local occasion at the end of the season.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/astypalaia/#chora-feast-of-osios-anthimos-chora
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/astypalaia/#chora-feast-of-osios-anthimos-chora
END:VEVENT
